<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A6206025" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Steering Gear Case Bushing Removal and Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A6206020">Steering Gear Case Assembly Components</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A6206025001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove steering gear case assembly. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A6206024"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Push out steering gear case bushing using hydraulic press (1) and special tools.
</ptxt>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L6B002">
<s-part>
(A)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09943-88211">
09943–88211
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
<servicetoolitem id = "L6B003">
<s-part>
(B)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09914-87210">
09914–87210
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A620017.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "54.605mm" ver = "01" gw = "187" gh = "138"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A6206025002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Press-fit new steering gear case bushing (1) using special tools and hydraulic press (2), noting the following points.
</ptxt>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Before installing bushing, apply soapy water on its circumference to facilitate installation.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L6B004">
<s-part>
(A)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09943-88211">
09943–88211
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
<servicetoolitem id = "L6B005">
<s-part>
(B)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09914-87210">
09914–87210
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A620018.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "60.911mm" ver = "01" gw = "189" gh = "156"/>
